      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the code for CDMA status report is strange, it will be much reasonable to check ERROR_CLASS for temporary errors or permanent errors.\n\nHowever, many CDMA SMS related designs are not transparent to framework/app developers, I\u0027m\nnot sure is it really an improvement to modify it. I skip it.",
