      "writtenOn": "2018-09-14T04:35:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about applying simple matching up CDMA status with GSM TP-Status as follows.\n\n+        com.android.internal.telephony.cdma.SmsMessage sms \u003d\n+                com.android.internal.telephony.cdma.SmsMessage.createFromPdu(pdu);\n+        boolean complete \u003d false;\n+        boolean success \u003d false;\n+        if (sms !\u003d null) {\n+            int errorClass \u003d (sms.getStatus() \u003e\u003e 24) \u0026 0x03;\n+            // TODO: CDMA status:ERROR_TEMPORARY is same with GSM TP-Status:Temporary error?\n+            if (errorClass !\u003d ERROR_TEMPORARY) {\n+                // Update the message status (COMPLETE or FAILED)\n+                tracker.updateSentMessageStatus(\n+                        mContext,\n+                        (errorClass \u003d\u003d ERROR_NONE) ? Sms.STATUS_COMPLETE : Sms.STATUS_FAILED);\n+                complete \u003d true;\n+            }\n+            success \u003d triggerDeliveryIntent(tracker, format, pdu);\n+        }\n+        return new Pair(success, complete);",
      "parentUuid": "0cae9e80_09f60bbd",
      "revId": "e4fe27ad4855d68647c090f1cd0a5c1dec4a92a2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "07ef5c8f_b5679f61",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/SmsDispatchersController.java",
