      "writtenOn": "2018-09-14T06:59:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I give up my change of GSM SMS and will not modify it for CDMA SMS.\nBecause I afraid there is a SMSC which does not send a status report of success/permanent error after status reports of temporary error.\n\nTo your idea, there may be some APPs which store GSM/CDMA SMS status field in sms table and manipulate it perfectly according to GSM/CDMA SMS SPECs. There may be compatibility problems if we store GSM status value for CDMA SMS.\n\nHowever, thank you for your idea.",
      "parentUuid": "c12fc6f6_15d1887b",
      "revId": "e4fe27ad4855d68647c090f1cd0a5c1dec4a92a2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
